Benchmark run traces in this folder contain the full text of every model request
and response. That text includes passages of the datasets below, so each trace is
subject to the terms of the dataset it was made from. Records hold ids and scores
only.

Each dataset adds one line here when it is added to the harness:
<dataset> | <license> | <terms and source>
LegalBench-RAG | MIT | https://github.com/zeroentropy-ai/legalbenchrag
PrivacyQA | MIT | https://github.com/AbhilashaRavichander/PrivacyQA_EMNLP
ContractNLI | CC BY 4.0 | https://stanfordnlp.github.io/contract-nli/
CUAD | CC BY 4.0 | https://www.atticusprojectai.org/cuad
MAUD | license not verified | https://github.com/TheAtticusProject/maud
FinanceBench annotations | CC BY-NC 4.0 | https://huggingface.co/datasets/PatronusAI/financebench
FinanceBench filings | public SEC filings and issuer press releases; copyright stays with the issuers | https://github.com/patronus-ai/financebench
